OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and often wet day
OL,6,Fahead with some outbreaks of heavier
OL,7,Frain possible throughout the day. Low
OL,8,Fcloud with fog likely over higher
OL,9,Fground. Light southeasterly winds but
OL,10,Ffeeling rather chilly.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud and rain gradually
OL,13,Fclearing northeastward through the
OL,14,Fnight, leaving drier conditions and
OL,15,Fsome clear spells by dawn acriss the
OL,16,Fregion.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
