OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FTurning windier through
OL,6,FWednesday as cloud and rain spread
OL,7,Fnortheastward across the region, some
OL,8,Fof which may be heavy at times.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly beneath cloud and rain.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FMore
OL,12,Fsettled on Thursday with brighter
OL,13,Fskies and lighter winds. A spell of
OL,14,Fwet and very windy weather arrives
OL,15,Ffrom the southwest Friday, before
OL,16,Fturning more settled once again
OL,17,Fthereafter.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
